      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carlton%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Railroad employees began calling the unnamed stop Carl's town, which eventually shortened to the name Carlton.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
